// Fixture for TtsLineExtractor: a phone contact's story played as a voiced call
// (F17). HaX's own prefix, a co-speaker by prefix, an unprefixed line, the
// player's line and narration (neither voiced on the phone).
// Compile: bin/inklecate -o phone_call_host.json phone_call_host.ink
-> call

=== call ===
Agent HaX: Don't hang up.
Director Netherton: Put her on when she's done.
Stay on the line.
You: I'm here.
Narrator: The line crackles.
The signal drops for a second. #speaker:narrator
-> END
